            array('id' => '15','key' => 'faq-section','value' => '{"language":{"en":{"heading":"Faq Section","sub_heading":"Advanced Security Features Designed to Protect Your Information Effectively","details":"Our security system employs advanced technology to ensure the utmost protection for your sensitive information. With state-of-the-art encryption, multi-layered authentication, and real-time monitoring, your data is safeguarded against unauthorized access and breaches. Experience peace of mind knowing that our robust security measures are designed to keep your information secure and private at all times."},"es":{"heading":"Secci\\u00f3n de preguntas frecuentes","sub_heading":"unciones de seguridad avanzadas dise\\u00f1adas para proteger tu informaci\\u00f3n de manera efectiva.","details":"Nuestro sistema de seguridad emplea tecnolog\\u00eda avanzada para garantizar la m\\u00e1xima protecci\\u00f3n de tu informaci\\u00f3n sensible. Con cifrado de \\u00faltima generaci\\u00f3n, autenticaci\\u00f3n en m\\u00faltiples capas y monitoreo en tiempo real, tus datos est\\u00e1n protegidos contra accesos no autorizados y brechas de seguridad. Disfruta de tranquilidad sabiendo que nuestras s\\u00f3lidas medidas de seguridad est\\u00e1n dise\\u00f1adas para mantener tu informaci\\u00f3n segura y privada en todo momento."},"ar":{"heading":"\\u0642\\u0633\\u0645 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0633\\u0626\\u0644\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0634\\u0627\\u0626\\u0639\\u0629","sub_heading":"\\u0645\\u064a\\u0632\\u0627\\u062a \\u0623\\u0645\\u0627\\u0646 \\u0645\\u062a\\u0642\\u062f\\u0645\\u0629 \\u0645\\u0635\\u0645\\u0645\\u0629 \\u0644\\u062d\\u0645\\u0627\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0645\\u0639\\u0644\\u0648\\u0645\\u0627\\u062a\\u0643 \\u0628\\u0641\\u0639\\u0627\\u0644\\u064a\\u0629.","details":"\\u064a\\u0633\\u062a\\u062e\\u062f\\u0645 \\u0646\\u0638\\u0627\\u0645 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0645\\u0627\\u0646 \\u0644\\u062f\\u064a\\u0646\\u0627 \\u062a\\u0642\\u0646\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0645\\u06